# Copy sang .env.local roi dien token that. KHONG commit .env.local.

# === football-data.org (v4) - nguon du lieu duy nhat cua app ===
# Dang ky mien phi, khong can the tin dung:
#   https://www.football-data.org/client/register
# Token gui qua email ngay sau khi dang ky.
#
# Goi free cho phep:
#   - 12 giai (Premier League, La Liga, Bundesliga, Serie A, Ligue 1,
#     Champions League, Championship, Eredivisie, Primeira Liga, ...)
#   - MUA HIEN TAI (khac API-Football free chi cho toi mua 2024/25)
#   - 10 request/phut, KHONG gioi han tong so request moi ngay
#   - Ty so cham tre vai phut, khong co ty so truc tiep tuc thi
#
# Goi free KHONG co: Europa League, FA Cup, Carabao Cup.
FOOTBALL_DATA_TOKEN=your_football_data_token_here
